[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4027.589, "timestamp": "01:07:07", "text": "我觉得呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4029.99, "timestamp": "01:07:09", "text": "如果你，如果你，是的。如果你不知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4032.63, "timestamp": "01:07:12", "text": "如果我猜是，如果你希望我喜欢的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4035.029, "timestamp": "01:07:15", "text": "也欢迎大家提出建议。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4037.109, "timestamp": "01:07:17", "text": "是的。您有什么建议？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4039.829, "timestamp": "01:07:19", "text": "嗯，一般来说，轻薄的羊毛最受欢迎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4042.39, "timestamp": "01:07:22", "text": "这里很有用，因为之后你作为一名德鲁伊……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4044.15, "timestamp": "01:07:24", "text": "实际上，你可以获得其他方面的访问权限。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4046.789, "timestamp": "01:07:26", "text": "造成伤害可能会绊倒人。光是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4049.029, "timestamp": "01:07:29", "text": "总体来说在这里相当有用。虽然如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4053.51, "timestamp": "01:07:33", "text": "你想……嗯，但是如果你觉得……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4056.23, "timestamp": "01:07:36", "text": "你会想要那里有神圣的火焰。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4057.829, "timestamp": "01:07:37", "text": "那也算是个还不错的罐头吧。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4059.51, "timestamp": "01:07:39", "text": "虽然不是最具破坏性的，但也相当严重。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4062.549, "timestamp": "01:07:42", "text": "还有，嗯，但它是为数不多的几个法术之一。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4065.029, "timestamp": "01:07:45", "text": "忽略掩护"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4067.43, "timestamp": "01:07:47", "text": "或者可以去旅行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4069.99, "timestamp": "01:07:49", "text": "哦，无视掩体。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4071.51, "timestamp": "01:07:51", "text": "是的。但是，光也像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4075.829, "timestamp": "01:07:55", "text": "一般来说，对于某些方面来说非常有用，比如……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4077.91, "timestamp": "01:07:57", "text": "即使你整个团队都……"}]